---
description:
  Per-subgraph direction under the layered layout. The first LR subgraph keeps its own
  direction; the second inherits the diagram's TB because an edge crosses into it.
config:
  layout: layered
---
flowchart TB
  top[Top] --> own
  subgraph own [Own direction]
    direction LR
    o1[One] --> o2[Two] --> o3[Three]
  end
  own --> c1
  subgraph crossed [Crossed]
    direction LR
    c1[Alpha] --> c2[Beta]
  end
  c2 --> c2
